Kancho Bodh Narayan Yadav (IKO-Member) is the most youngest Hanshi and Kancho in the World. He is learning Kyokushin Karate since his child hood at the age of 3 years only , he has complited his 8th Dan Black Belt after succiding in the 80 men kumite ate his age of 40 years only after that he became Kanco of his World Registered Organisation The World Kyokushin Karate Federation (WKKF) at the age of 41 years only. He is hard working, Regular and most technical Karateka and Prominant Kyokushin Practitioner. He is going to creat the another World History by Organising The Karate World Cup 2018 . Previously he has organised National, South Asian, Asian and Internationa Karate Championship in the year 2017-18. Morethan 100 countries are going to be invited in the World Cup . He has been awrded several times for his great potential work

